  "Solution": {
    "S": "Rate of diffusion is defined as the volume of gas diffusing per unit time.\n\nVolume is measured in $\\text{dm}^3$ and time in seconds (s).\n\nTherefore, the SI unit is $\\text{dm}^3 \\, \\text{s}^{-1}$.\n\nHence, the correct option is B."
  },
